# Native C++ (IME Aura)

- C++20 in `src/`.
- Windows overlay: Windows.UI.Composition only; no D3D/D2D device in the host path.
- COM: use WRL `Microsoft::WRL::ComPtr` or C++/WinRT `winrt::` types; no raw `Release` leaks.
- MSVC release builds: static CRT (`/MT`), `WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN`, `NOMINMAX`, `/utf-8`.
- OS code stays in `src/platform/{windows,macos,linux}`; shared logic in `src/core`.
- Settings JSON schema is defined in `src/core/settings.{h,cpp}`; preserve backward compatibility on changes.
